  "bodyHash": "rO6Gy8GmVF4=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/779003b33033f9344341f20e426f3336e1b49db2.png\" alt=\"Logo\"> </p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d4900d00779bb1689812db5ad1ae1f7e7bd47242_0.webp\" alt=\"Banner\"></p><hr><h2>關於本模組</h2><p>「石中劍」是一款武器模組，透過在世界各處添加獨特有趣的劍來提升探索樂趣。<strong>支援Forge 1.18.2/1.19.2/1.19.4/1.20.1及NeoForge 1.21版本，無需任何前置模組。</strong></p><h2>劍之石</h2><p>劍之石是會生成在三大維度的特殊結構，每塊石頭都封存著獨特劍刃——其樣式會隨生成生態域變化。這些特殊劍刃擁有隨機攻擊力與攻速數值，<strong>更附帶隨機魔法能力</strong>。對石塊長按右鍵即可拔出石中劍。</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/3HWZ1ync/images/25d4654ed2e945a55ca91d5d66a01d5f7b5918a8.png\" alt=\"\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/3HWZ1ync/images/3940583212cb93d012be1f7fe800c7dd2563f158.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>在玩家拔劍前，石中劍會週期性向上發射雷射光束，方便玩家定位。</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/3HWZ1ync/images/f2cf914bcaff3044afd82d0abbab08f38776de83.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h2>魔法能力</h2><p>每把劍隨機附帶9種魔法能力之一，詳見物品提示說明，劍名顏色也會隨能力改變。部分能力為被動效果，另一些則需右鍵觸發。</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/3HWZ1ync/images/52d1d871b66afaedadfc3bcc5be725c10b2af6c7.gif\" alt=\"\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/3HWZ1ync/images/16323b4c29f811db4c6cebf361032996f0979c30.gif\" alt=\"\"></p><hr><h3><strong>2.0版本起，遊戲內共有54種劍刃組合等待發掘！</strong></h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/3HWZ1ync/images/e7aeed3d45f2b76cd5a333a70c93cf5d136002b1.gif\" alt=\"sword combinations\"></p><h2>常見問題</h2><p>可以加入模組包嗎？&nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p><code>歡迎自由將本模組加入任何模組包</code></p></div><p>允許移植/分叉嗎？</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>請先聯繫原作者</p></div><p>發現錯誤或想建議新功能？</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>請至Github議題頁面回報：<a href=\"https://github.com/BrownBear85/swordinthestone/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/BrownBear85/swordinthestone/issues</a></p></div><h2><strong>盡情享受「石中劍」的冒險吧！</strong></h2>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
